        <mxCell id="flow_box" parent="1" style="fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;spacing=8;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fillColor=#F7F9FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=12;fontColor=#333333;" value="&lt;b&gt;MAIN ORDER FLOW&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39; color=&#39;#777777&#39;&gt;(follow the numbers on the arrows)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Reseller / operator SPA calls the API (GraphQL over HTTPS).&lt;br&gt;② API appends Order events + an outbox row in one transaction.&lt;br&gt;③ Worker&#39;s outbox relay publishes the event to SNS FIFO.&lt;br&gt;④ SNS fans out (filtered) to SQS FIFO queues (with DLQ).&lt;br&gt;⑤ Worker consumers pick it up (routing, projections).&lt;br&gt;⑥ Worker submits the order to Odoo via JSON-RPC.&lt;br&gt;⑦ Odoo pushes status changes back to the API webhook route.&lt;br&gt;⑧ Worker delivers HMAC-signed status webhooks to resellers." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="265" width="420" x="20" y="675" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
